As i said before, this version we focused in new features, besides we still fixing bugs. Note that we changed the version from V1.1.20.X to V1.2.20.0. This means that we are in a new patch, so we consider this version the most significant after the launch.

Remember that the format is: V{version}.{patch}.{year}.{debug}.

